  "description": "CR 707.2a a copy of Titania's Song hands over its own effect",
  "note": "A Copy Enchantment copying Titania's Song hands its own effect over as it leaves, which it can only do if the departure reads the copy's static abilities rather than Copy Enchantment's printed face. Jade Statue is the probe that separates the copy's handover from the original's: it enters after Angelic Edict exiled the original, so CR 611.2c had already frozen the original's effect to a set without it, and only the copy's handover keeps it a 4/4 once a second Edict exiles the copy. Both Songs go, in that order: the copy needs the original on the battlefield to enter as it (CR 707.5), and a Song still in play would animate the Statue live.",
